# the two reviewable .md reports ARE committed.
_bmad-output/ml-training/non-rekordbox-survey.json

# Story 7.3 — per-run ablation model artifacts. Only the large/regenerable ones
# are ignored: the model weights, the per-epoch log, and the run-B split sidecar.
# model_metadata.json IS committed (DD #8 forensic record). The harness (.py), the
# .md docs, and non-rekordbox-unsupervised-pretrain-manifest.json are committed;
# kdd-b2-comparison-v1.md is the operator-produced AC12 deliverable.
_bmad-output/ml-training/ablation/*/model.pt
_bmad-output/ml-training/ablation/*/model.pt.partial
_bmad-output/ml-training/ablation/*/training_log.json
_bmad-output/ml-training/ablation/*/run_b_random_split.json

# Epic 7 — substrate-v2 close-out. Regenerable: the Phase-1 smoke checkpoints, the
# operator-run FR-18 prediction dumps, and the large v2 training weights + logs.
# Committed: the per-seed model_metadata.json (forensic) + the eval .json/.md reports.
_bmad-output/ml-training/ablation/v2-smoke/
_bmad-output/ml-training/fr18-predictions/
_bmad-output/ml-training/v2-runs/*/seed_*/model.pt
_bmad-output/ml-training/v2-runs/*/seed_*/training_log.json

# Local review scratch output (NOT shipped)
_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/review-tmp/

# Story 7.7 — the sealed GiantSteps holdout hash-list is LOCAL ONLY (smallest
# leak surface, DD #10). Only the committed giantsteps-holdout-v2-manifest.md
